precision fusion/evidence+prior gradients/conditional KL zero/extreme stable precisions passed
| selected epoch | test NLL | lower KL | top KL | negative ELBO | greedy MSE | fit-mean MSE |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 3 | 234.154285068 | 7.508566750 | 4.866975254 | 246.529827071 | 0.073145999 | 0.048548290 |
